WEBVTT

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. 

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. 

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. 

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! 

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid 

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. 

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. 

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! 

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. 

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! 

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. 

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! 

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. 

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.740
Seiyo Elementary School

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.680
5th Grade Star Class

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:56.420
And so, your very merry winter vacation begins tomorrow!

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.880
Yay!

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:01.920
It'll be an onset of fun events with Christmas and New Year's,

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.940
but please try to keep yourselves in check.

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:05.930
Okay!

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:09.490
And take care to avoid any accidents.

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:11.180
Right, Himamori-san?

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:12.310
Huh?

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:15.910
Accidents happen when you least expect them.

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:19.550
Right.

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:22.970
Wait a second, why did he single me out?

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:27.970
A Sad Christmas Eve!

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:27.970
Episode 12

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:35.780
She's here!

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:37.430
Amu-chi!

00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:38.750
Sorry. Did I keep you waiting?

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:39.730
It's fine.

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:41.430
We just got here.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:44.180
Getting together to go out on the town is so exciting!

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.470
What should we do? Where should we go? What should we eat?

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:51.310
We're here today to shop for tomorrow's Christmas party.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.350
She seems to have completely forgotten.

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:55.610
No! Let's have fun! Fun!

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:58.010
Games! Karaoke! Bowling!

00:02:58.010 --> 00:02:59.520
No.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:03.970
Cradling, as if precious, the shards 

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:03.970
Na-chin's so mean!

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:06.850
of dreams that have no place left to go. 

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:13.860
As sleep is about to take you, 

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:12.730
Ah, it's terrible!

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:14.570
What's wrong, Su?

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:19.880
where will you find a pleasant dream? 

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:23.140
Kiss the starry sky; 

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:28.890
the time has come for good children to sleep.

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.340
Huh? She's...

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:26.680
That girl!

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:31.020
Ah, Hoshina Utau.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.350
You know her?

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:38.510
Don't stare at me, don't capture me. 

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:35.570
Of course! She's amazing!

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.990
She was a model at age fourteen,

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:40.410
and her debut song is already number one.

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:45.850
I'm a butterfly that's lost her way. 

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:43.540
She's a smash hit!

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:52.390
I sing of freedom on invisible wings;   

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:48.870
We should get going.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.470
Let's go!

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:59.350
I've hidden them deep inside your heart.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.110
I've always thought she was pretty,

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.880
but I'm surprised she's actually famous.

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:13.890
Stop! Stop! Stopping!

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:16.600
That was very, very bad dancing!

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:18.880
Absolutely atrocious, Utau-chan!

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.330
My motions were perfect.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:21.270
My rhythm as well.

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.360
Sure, of course.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:27.020
But your dancing has no soul.

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:32.220
A dance with no soul cannot captivate the hearts of the audience!

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:43.190
There isn't much time left before your concert.

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:45.140
We'll have problems if you're like this.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.480
I told you this isn't a game.

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:51.780
You are working for the Easter company.

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:54.020
You signed the contract.

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:58.030
You can't just sing and dance as you please.

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:01.130
I see.

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:03.020
So you don't care what happens to Ikuto-kun.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:12.100
Once more from the top, please.

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:14.900
Wow!

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:16.520
You're finally eager to learn!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.690
I'm so happy!

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:20.520
Such a cute girl.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.430
CD sales were higher than expected.

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:28.890
The project is progressing at an excellent pace.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.160
Her singing has a special power.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.710
I'll find the Embryo very soon.

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:38.310
However...

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:42.810
Doesn't this Hoshina Utau girl have a number of issues?

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:47.510
Any potential irregularities she may have can be found in any girl her age.

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:49.900
I'll be in control.

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:51.870
You needn't worry.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.550
Hello.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:56.390
Sorry about being late.

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:59.430
I had to show up at work even though it's winter break.

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:01.640
It's not easy being a teacher.

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:02.640
Disgusting.

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:03.830
Hey, Yuu.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.250
Don't use that character outside of school.

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:08.270
It's somehow become a habit.

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.160
How can you call yourself a teacher

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:11.850
when you hate children?

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:15.350
It's all part of my plan

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:20.560
to efficiently collect eggs from weak children.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:21.620
Oh?

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.850
The Embryo is a special egg.

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:28.220
It should be hidden in children filled with hopes and dreams.

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:31.220
That's where my Utau will come in handy.

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:35.180
I'll be the one to find the Embryo.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:37.430
Not if you keep failing.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:40.390
Carry on as long as you like, you'll never find the Embryo.

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:43.470
Not with your slow methods.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:44.470
That's enough.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.720
I don't care which method is used.

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:52.560
Find the Embryo for the Boss without delay.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.080
You can count on me, Director.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.560
I will surely deliver the Embryo to the Boss.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:06.180
Not good!

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:08.040
I'll get in trouble if I'm not home soon!

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.470
Hurry, Amu-chan!

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:10.850
Run hard!

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:13.060
At a time like this...

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:15.130
Special attack: Shortcut!

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.220
No way!

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:25.020
No!

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:27.590
I have a feeling this is taking longer.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.000
Yep.

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:33.850
Huh?

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:35.390
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:37.910
Don't tell me...

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.380
I think I'm lost.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:42.960
What? What do we do? What do we do?

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:42.960
Don't tell me you have no sense of direction.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:54.590
What's this sound?

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:55.920
An instrument?

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:57.980
It's beautiful.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:07:59.120
Let's check it out.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:07:59.520
Yeah.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:00.220
Ah.

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:03.130
Aren't you supposed to hurry home?

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:17.870
Wow, cool!

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.720
It's a street concert.

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.100
The enthusiasm's incredible.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:24.180
Everyone's having fun!

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:29.360
But this isn't the sound I heard.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.110
What I heard was...

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.060
This sound!

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:35.600
Wait, Amu-chan!

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:39.930
It's farther in?

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:01.890
I-Ikuto?

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:07.970
It's different from the cheerful singers and intense guitars.

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.850
What a melancholic sound.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.520
What are you doing here?

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.770
N-Nothing.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:31.560
You're stopping?

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:32.720
Yeah.

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.650
Are you leaving?

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:40.770
You're not going to finish that song?

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:42.140
It's done.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.850
Huh? Why?

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:47.500
Ah.

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:49.970
Aren't you going to play by the street over there?

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:52.750
More people would hear you that way.

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:56.430
I'm not playing for other people to listen.

00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:59.310
You eavesdropper.

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:03.030
Y-You were the one playing out in the open!

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:04.270
That's right! That's right!

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.050
Wh-What?

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:11.950
Don't tell anyone about this.

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:12.640
Huh?

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.570
U-Um...

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:20.190
It'll be a secret between you and me; just the two of us.

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:20.560
Huh?

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:31.960
I-If you insist, I guess I m-might be willing to keep quiet.

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.380
You're tripping over yourself.

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:34.200
Shut up!

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:35.520
Isn't it true, though?

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:36.930
Th-That was on purpose!

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:38.750
Why would I ever stutter?

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:39.990
See ya.

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:41.300
Wait!

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:42.990
Play just one more time!

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:44.710
Don't want to.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:46.250
Come on! Please?

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:49.060
I want to hear your violin again.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:53.150
Your playing was kind of sad.

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:55.660
But it was really beautiful, too.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:59.350
So, please?

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.830
Have you forgotten?

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:08.790
We're enemies.

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:10.340
Enemies?

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:15.900
The Easter people are getting serious.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.060
Now's your last chance to get out.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.610
What is Easter anyway?

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:48.550
I wish he'd give a better explanation.

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:51.310
Well, he is our enemy.

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.510
I suppose that's true.

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:56.060
Enemy, huh?

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:57.720
Found them.

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:09.970
But he's awfully nice for an enemy.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:12.290
What is this for?

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.400
You made a dessert like that before, right?

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:20.660
I heard your Guardian Character went off towards the neighboring town.

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:23.680
And that

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:29.090
sad yet beautiful sound...

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.920
Ah, jeez!

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:43.640
What is Ikuto really like?

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:56.850
Da lost butterfwy!

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:56.850
That's wonderful, Ami-chan!

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:57.510
Yay, yay, Ami-chan!

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:59.410
Sure is noisy.

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:59.410
Bravo, Ami-chan! Yay!

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:01.520
You're the best!

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:04.970
Hey, this song is...

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:08.560
Hoshina Utau's.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.970
Ami, do you like this song?

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:12.740
Yep!

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.720
When I grow up, I wanna be Utau-chan!

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:20.830
Didn't you just say you want to be like me?

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.240
Now now.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.220
Honestly.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:26.520
But if even Ami's hooked on her,

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:28.310
she must be popular.

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:30.390
That reminds me...

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:38.820
Maybe she's Ikuto's girlfriend?

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:50.180
And back. And forward.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.390
And back. And back again.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.710
And forward!

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:56.200
Back. Forward.

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:11.590
Your playing was kind of sad.

00:14:11.590 --> 00:14:14.890
But it was really beautiful, too.

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:18.270
Are you thinking about her?

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:20.720
The girl whose lock goes with that key.

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:26.100
Not really.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:29.020
Ikuto.

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:36.230
Ikuto, I have a request to make.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:40.870
I want to see you tonight,

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:42.590
no matter what it takes.

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:44.810
Because it's Christmas Eve.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:57.830
Work?

00:14:58.280 --> 00:14:59.100
Yeah.

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:02.970
I barely have any free time these days.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:06.270
I should be able to sneak out around eight.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:08.520
I'll be waiting.

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:10.720
I'll be waiting.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.470
You have to come.

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:23.590
A date on Christmas Eve.

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:26.020
How romantic.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.290
She's so earnest it brings a tear to my eye.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:46.100
That girl would do anything for you.

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:50.140
She'd even choose to do very bad things.

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:57.260
How long are you going to act like an outsider, Tsukiyomi Ikuto-kun?

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:02.100
You should hurry up and realize you're the reason she's falling to the dark side.

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:13.470
Ikuto?

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:20.100
I'll make you work hard.

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.230
For my purposes.

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.460
Yaya, be more careful when you decorate.

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:36.970
Jeez, you're so picky.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:40.950
This is quite a feast, considering everyone simply brought something from home.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:44.700
Unlike how we relied on Hinamori-san during training camp.

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:45.390
Huh?

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:49.850
I Character Changed, so it was almost all Su.

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:51.600
Ta-da!

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:53.770
Whoa, awesome!

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:54.470
That looks good!

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:56.990
I made the cake!

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.430
That's our Su!

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:00.830
I designed it.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.430
That's our Miki!

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:04.920
What did you do, Ran-tan-dechu?

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.080
Cheered!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:08.430
That's what I figured.

00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:09.440
Okay.

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:11.550
I think that takes care of the preparations.

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:13.620
Indeed. Shall we begin?

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:14.850
Wait a second!

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:17.190
I brought something nice!

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:20.620
Do you mean this?

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.150
Isn't this fun?

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:24.640
Yes, it really adds to the excitement.

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:28.920
My plan to make Christmas more exciting was a success!

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:31.900
What does a bunny costume have to do with Christmas?

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:33.220
Boing!

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:38.080
I'm not too crazy about wearing the same costume as Kukai.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:40.810
A girl wearing the same thing as a boy is kind of...

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:43.040
Oh? You look very cute.

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:43.620
Yeah.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:46.570
You look much better than I do, Hinamori!

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:48.060
R-Really?

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:52.100
I bet you've got enough horsepower to save Santa from any trouble!

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:53.720
Why am I

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:56.260
a lion?

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:58.430
That's pathetic, Tadase.

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:00.460
Because you're the King.

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:02.180
It suits you perfectly!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.540
Yep! Yep!

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:06.600
And now you're hooked on something you shouldn't be.

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:08.730
But it's so embarrassing.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.880
Everybody's embarrassed.

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:12.520
You look really happy about yours!

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:15.970
Well, there's no point in complaining forever.

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:18.270
Let's get the party started!

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:19.970
Ready and...

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:24.050
Merry Christmas!

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:10.720
Come back here, Utau!

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:13.100
You still have to meet with everyone!

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:14.500
Wait!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.310
Ikuto.

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:19.890
Utau!

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:23.160
Honestly.

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:27.000
The party was fun!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:27.580
Yep.

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:28.970
A huge blast!

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:33.440
Tadase-kun as a lion was super cute, wasn't he?

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:34.960
Y-You think?

00:19:34.960 --> 00:19:36.630
It wasn't anything special, was it?

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:38.790
It had you pretty giddy.

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:39.890
Oh, zip it!

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.280
Huh? What's wrong?

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:46.610
I can sense an X Egg.

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:47.690
She's right.

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:49.130
It's really big.

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:51.890
I have a very bad feeling about this.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.020
Let's go.

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:53.890
Yeah!

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:04.810
X Eggs.

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:06.910
A lot of them.

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:18.420
They were all having so much fun yesterday.

00:20:19.370 --> 00:20:21.100
Ah, Amu-chan!

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:36.760
Ikuto!

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:53.900
Ikuto.

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:08.100
Stay back!

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:13.760
Stay away from me.

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:15.470
Ikuto!

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:31.340
He's gone.

00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:34.140
The X Eggs disappeared, too.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:46.160
Ikuto.

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:41.290
As long as I exist, even when I'm a pile of dust, 

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:47.690
I'll keep cheering "you can do it, you can do it" out loud! 

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:48.510
(You can do it!)

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:54.670
I'll never stop as long as I live,  

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:01.020
so I'll sing my never-ending song. 

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:05.530
I'll press forward down my path. 

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.050
Even random characters have their merits. 

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:13.890
You might be worthless, but I'll still love you, 

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:15.360
my darling.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.150
You idiot! My true self... 

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:22.110
Just say what's on your mind. 

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:25.540
You're sticking out a little. 

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:28.810
You're coming closer to my dream. 

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.590
You jerk! My true self... 

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.840
Please come out, don't hide. 

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:41.780
Oh yeah! Right now! 

00:23:50.750 --> 00:23:53.150
The year's almost over.

00:23:53.150 --> 00:23:54.620
After Christmas comes...

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:55.770
New Year's!

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:56.870
That's right.

00:23:56.870 --> 00:24:00.350
Hoshina Utau's supposed to be in the Ringing in the New Year concert.

00:24:00.350 --> 00:24:01.610
Hoshina Utau?

00:24:01.610 --> 00:24:03.730
With her debut song, Butterfly's Labyrinth!

00:24:03.730 --> 00:24:05.360
It's a big hit!

00:24:05.360 --> 00:24:06.850
There's trouble on the horizon.

00:24:06.850 --> 00:24:08.440
Like mass panic?

00:24:08.440 --> 00:24:09.890
Perhaps!

00:24:09.890 --> 00:24:11.470
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.470 --> 00:24:13.330
Big Disturbance! New Year Live!

00:24:13.330 --> 00:24:15.120
X Eggs are being made like crazy!

00:24:15.120 --> 00:24:16.550
Amu-chan, Character Transform!

00:24:16.550 --> 00:24:17.150
Okay!

00:24:17.150 --> 00:24:20.100
I won't let you X out who someone wants to be!
